{"title":"Inner Engineering In Person","startsAt":"2026-11-19T18:00:00-05:00","endsAt":"2026-11-22T19:00:00-05:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Please click [here](https://online.innerengineering.com/en/program-details/inner-engineering-in-person-cityprogram-polish-veterans---sikorski-hall-ontario-ca-jan-29-2026) to learn more and register.\n\nThis is a paid program.\n\nInner Engineering Total is offered as a 4-day or 7-day, in-person program. The course combines the tools from Inner Engineering Online and transmission of Shambhavi Mahamudra Kriya, a 21-minute life-transforming practice.\n\nThis format includes Upa Yoga, a set of practices that activate the joints, muscles and energy system, powerful meditative processes and practice support through personalized corrections.\n\nProgram Date and Timings:\nThursday, November 19th, 6:00 PM - 9:15 PM\nFriday, November 20th, 6:00 PM - 9:15 PM\nSaturday, November 21st, 8:30 AM - 7:00 PM\nSunday, November 22nd, 7:30 AM - 7:00 PM\n\nAttendance to all sessions is mandatory.\n\nOpen to ages 15 years and above.\n\nProgram Guidelines & session information:\nPrograms are on Thursday and Friday evenings for 3 1/4 hours and continue all day on Saturday and Sunday.\n\nVegetarian lunch is provided on Saturday; Vegetarian breakfast & lunch on Sunday.\n\nProgram Fee: 375 CAD. Early bird discount: CAD 330 (Expires on October 20th 2026). Group discounts are also available - please email or call the city contact listed above to register as a group:\n\n* $350 for groups of 2-4\n* $325 for groups of 5 or more\n\nContact information:\n![](https://online.innerengineering.com/_next/static/media/reg-email-icon.99181b01.svg)[toronto@ishafoundation.org](mailto:toronto@ishafoundation.org)\n![](https://online.innerengineering.com/_next/static/media/reg-phone-icon.c4a3a0d9.svg)\\[\\(647\\) 797\\-3350\\]\\(tel:\\(647\\) 797\\-3350\\)","venue":{"name":"Polish Combatants' Hall (SPK)","address":"206 Beverley St, Toronto, ON M5T 1Z3, Canada, Toronto","lat":43.65706,"lng":-79.39538,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":{"amount":375,"currency":"CAD"},"group":"Inner Engineering Toronto (Isha Yoga & Meditation Classes)","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/7/5/d/c/highres_531930172.jpeg"}